{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "constructaiq-backend-api",
    "name": "ConstructaIQ Backend API",
    "description": "Postman collection for the ConstructaIQ FastAPI backend.\n\n**Setup**\n1. Import `ConstructaIQ-Local.postman_environment.json`\n2. Start the API: `uvicorn app.main:app --reload --port 8000`\n3. Ensure `.env` has Azure Foundry credentials; `DATABASE_URL` for project endpoints\n\n**Recommended flow**\n1. Health Check → Create Project (or Upload PDFs)\n2. Start Analyze (202) → Poll Analyze Status until `complete`\n3. Get Summary / Suppliers / Crew / Agents\n\n**6-agent pipeline** (fixed Foundry versions)\nContractAgent v4 → BlueprintAgent v3 → PermitAgent v3 → ScheduleAgent v2 → SupplierAgent v3 → CrewAgent v2\n\n**Analyze response keys:** `projectSummary`, `blueprintSummary`, `permitAssessment`, `projectPlan`, `supplierAnalysis`, `crewAnalysis` (+ optional `persistenceSummary`, `stored_documents`)\n\nCollection variables `projectId` and `jobId` are auto-set by test scripts on create/upload/analyze requests.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "hostUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8000" },
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8000/api/v1" },
    { "key": "projectId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "jobId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "supplierId", "value": "1" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Infrastructure",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health Check (Liveness)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{hostUrl}}/healthz",
            "description": "Process liveness probe (no /api prefix)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Health Check (Database)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{hostUrl}}/healthz/db",
            "description": "Azure SQL connectivity. Returns 503 if DB unavailable."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Projects — Lifecycle",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create Project",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    const data = body.data || body;",
                  "    if (data.project_id) {",
                  "        pm.collectionVariables.set('projectId', String(data.project_id));",
                  "        pm.environment.set('projectId', String(data.project_id));",
                  "    }",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test('Status 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"project_name\": \"Tower A — Postman Test\",\n  \"project_type\": \"Commercial\",\n  \"location\": \"Chicago, IL\",\n  \"client_name\": \"ACME Corp\",\n  \"scope\": \"42-floor mixed-use tower. Budget $186M, 28-month schedule. Structural steel, deep foundation, MEP fit-out.\",\n  \"duration_months\": 28,\n  \"floor_count\": 42,\n  \"complexity_level\": \"High\",\n  \"start_date\": \"2026-01-01\",\n  \"target_completion_date\": \"2028-05-01\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/projects",
            "description": "Creates a project record. Requires DATABASE_URL."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Upload Project PDFs",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    const data = body.data || body;",
                  "    if (data.project_id) {",
                  "        pm.collectionVariables.set('projectId', String(data.project_id));",
                  "        pm.environment.set('projectId', String(data.project_id));",
                  "    }",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test('Status 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                {
                  "key": "project_name",
                  "value": "Tower B — PDF Upload",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "key": "contract",
                  "description": "Select a PDF file",
                  "type": "file",
                  "src": []
                },
                {
                  "key": "blueprint",
                  "description": "Optional second PDF",
                  "type": "file",
                  "src": [],
                  "disabled": true
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/projects/upload",
            "description": "Multipart upload. At least one of contract or blueprint PDF required. Attaches files in Postman Body → form-data."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Start Analyze (Async 202)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 202) {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    const data = body.data || body;",
                  "    if (data.job_id) {",
                  "        pm.collectionVariables.set('jobId', data.job_id);",
                  "        pm.environment.set('jobId', data.job_id);",
                  "    }",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test('Status 202', () => pm.response.to.have.status(202));"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"description\": \"42-floor mixed-use commercial tower in downtown Chicago. Budget $186M, 28-month schedule. Structural steel framing, deep foundation, MEP fit-out.\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/analyze",
            "description": "Enqueues background 6-agent analyze job (~2 min). Poll Analyze Status until status=complete. Progress steps: ContractAgent → BlueprintAgent → PermitAgent → ScheduleAgent → SupplierAgent → CrewAgent. Uses project scope if description omitted."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Poll Analyze Status",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    const data = body.data || body;",
                  "    if (data.status === 'complete') {",
                  "        const result = data.result || {};",
                  "        const required = [",
                  "            'projectSummary', 'blueprintSummary', 'permitAssessment',",
                  "            'projectPlan', 'supplierAnalysis', 'crewAnalysis'",
                  "        ];",
                  "        const removed = [",
                  "            'projectHealth', 'knowledgeInsights', 'riskAnalysis', 'recoveryPlan'",
                  "        ];",
                  "        required.forEach(k => pm.test(`has ${k}`, () => pm.expect(result).to.have.property(k)));",
                  "        removed.forEach(k => pm.test(`no ${k}`, () => pm.expect(result).to.not.have.property(k)));",
                  "    }",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/analyze/status?job_id={{jobId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["projects", "{{projectId}}", "analyze", "status"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "job_id", "value": "{{jobId}}", "description": "Optional; defaults to latest job for project" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Poll every 5–10s until status is `complete` or `error`. Progress steps: ContractAgent → BlueprintAgent → PermitAgent → ScheduleAgent → SupplierAgent → CrewAgent. When complete, `result` includes the 6 pipeline keys only (no projectHealth, knowledgeInsights, riskAnalysis, recoveryPlan)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Upload Session",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/upload-session?job_id={{jobId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["projects", "{{projectId}}", "upload-session"],
              "query": [{ "key": "job_id", "value": "{{jobId}}" }]
            },
            "description": "Same job status mapped to frontend UploadSessionResponse shape (agentSteps, overallPct)."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Projects — Read",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Project",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}",
            "description": "Project metadata."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Summary (Intelligence)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/summary",
            "description": "ProjectIntelligenceData shape: permits, phases, crew requirements."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Suppliers",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/suppliers",
            "description": "Persisted procurement rows from SupplierAgent."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Crew Plans",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/crew",
            "description": "Persisted crew allocations from CrewAgent."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Agent Executions",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/agents",
            "description": "Full agent audit trail, newest first."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Analyze — Stateless",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Analyze Text (Mode 1 — Sync ~2min)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                { "key": "project_name", "value": "E2E Tower A", "type": "text" },
                {
                  "key": "description",
                  "value": "42-floor mixed-use commercial tower in downtown Chicago. Budget $186M, 28-month schedule. Structural steel framing, deep foundation, MEP fit-out.",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "key": "project_id",
                  "value": "{{projectId}}",
                  "type": "text",
                  "description": "Optional — persists outputs when DATABASE_URL set",
                  "disabled": true
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/analyze/text",
            "description": "Synchronous 6-agent pipeline (ContractAgent v4 → CrewAgent v2). No ApiResponse wrapper — returns raw camelCase blob with keys: projectSummary, blueprintSummary, permitAssessment, projectPlan, supplierAnalysis, crewAnalysis. Increase Postman timeout to 180s+."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Analyze Documents (Mode 2 — Sync ~2min)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                { "key": "project_name", "value": "Mode 2 Tower", "type": "text" },
                {
                  "key": "contract",
                  "type": "file",
                  "description": "Contract PDF",
                  "src": []
                },
                {
                  "key": "blueprint",
                  "type": "file",
                  "description": "Blueprint PDF (optional)",
                  "src": [],
                  "disabled": true
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/analyze/documents",
            "description": "PDF → Document Intelligence → same 6-agent pipeline. Response keys match Mode 1. Requires AZURE_DOCUMENT_INTELLIGENCE_* config. Increase Postman timeout to 180s+."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Catalogs",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List Suppliers",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "    const data = body.data || body;",
                  "    if (Array.isArray(data) && data[0]?.supplier_id) {",
                  "        pm.collectionVariables.set('supplierId', String(data[0].supplier_id));",
                  "    }",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/suppliers"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Supplier",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"supplier_code\": \"SUP-POSTMAN-001\",\n  \"supplier_name\": \"Postman Test Supplier\",\n  \"supplier_category\": \"Materials\",\n  \"location\": \"Chicago, IL\",\n  \"lead_time_days\": 14,\n  \"preferred_supplier\": true,\n  \"status\": \"active\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/suppliers"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "List Supplier Materials",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/suppliers/{{supplierId}}/materials"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Supplier Material",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"supplier_id\": {{supplierId}},\n  \"material_name\": \"Structural Steel\",\n  \"material_category\": \"Steel\",\n  \"unit_price\": 850.00,\n  \"currency_code\": \"USD\",\n  \"lead_time_days\": 21\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/suppliers/{{supplierId}}/materials"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "List Crew",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/crew"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Crew Member",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"employee_code\": \"CRW-POSTMAN-001\",\n  \"employee_name\": \"Jane Postman\",\n  \"skill_type\": \"Electrician\",\n  \"experience_years\": 8,\n  \"daily_rate\": 450.00,\n  \"availability_status\": \"available\",\n  \"location\": \"Chicago, IL\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/crew"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Debug",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Call Single Agent",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"agent_name\": \"ContractAgent\",\n  \"version\": \"default\",\n  \"text\": \"Project: 10-story office building in Austin TX. Budget $45M, 18 months. Client: BuildCo.\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/projects/call-agent",
            "description": "Direct Foundry agent invocation. Allowed agents: ContractAgent, BlueprintAgent, PermitAgent, ScheduleAgent, SupplierAgent, CrewAgent. version: \"default\" resolves to fixed pipeline versions (e.g. ContractAgent → 4); explicit version override still allowed."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Call ScheduleAgent",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"agent_name\": \"ScheduleAgent\",\n  \"version\": \"default\",\n  \"text\": \"{\\\"project_name\\\": \\\"Tower A\\\", \\\"budget\\\": 50000000, \\\"duration_months\\\": 18, \\\"permits\\\": [\\\"Building Permit\\\"]}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/projects/call-agent",
            "description": "Probe ScheduleAgent (v2 when version is default). Replaces legacy PlanningAgent in the pipeline."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Call Agent — Removed Agent (expect 400)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 400', () => pm.response.to.have.status(400));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "const detail = body.detail || (body.data && body.data.detail) || JSON.stringify(body);",
                  "pm.test('detail mentions allowed agents', () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(String(detail)).to.include('ContractAgent');",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"agent_name\": \"DoctorAgent\",\n  \"version\": \"default\",\n  \"text\": \"Diagnose project health for a 10-story office tower.\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/projects/call-agent",
            "description": "Removed agents (DoctorAgent, ConstructionKnowledgeAgent, RiskAgent, RecoveryAgent) return 400 with allowed pipeline agent list."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
